  <section className="relative overflow-hidden px-5 py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-24"><span className="pointer-events-none absolute -left-8 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 -rotate-90 display text-8xl text-bone/[.04]">KYLE PARKER</span><div className="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.78fr_1.22fr] lg:items-center xl:gap-16"><div className="content-frame aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden lg:-mb-16"><img src="/images/current-site/kyle-parker-founder.webp" alt="Kyle Parker racing on the California coast" className="h-full w-full object-cover"/></div><div className="relative z-10 min-w-0 lg:py-10"><p className="eyebrow text-signal">Kyle Parker · Founder</p><h1 className="display mt-5 max-w-4xl text-6xl leading-[.88] sm:text-7xl xl:text-8xl">The coach is in the work, too.</h1><p className="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-bone/70 xl:text-xl">Kyle Parker is a NASM Certified Personal Trainer, USAT Nationals qualifier, and athlete training for IRONMAN Florida 2026. His coaching is built on a simple belief: you don’t need more hype. You need a plan that fits your life, honest accountability, and the nerve to keep going when motivation disappears.</p><div className="mt-8 inline-flex w-fit max-w-full flex-wrap items-center gap-3 border border-signal p-4"><span className="display text-3xl text-signal">NASM-CPT</span><span className="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest">Certified Personal Trainer</span></div></div></div></section>

  <section className="bg-bone px-5 py-14 text-ink lg:px-8"><div className="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.55fr_1.45fr]"><div><span className="bib text-signal"><strong>001</strong> Why KO</span><h2 className="display mt-5 text-5xl sm:text-6xl">Why KO Fitness exists.</h2></div><div className="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2"><div><p className="text-2xl font-semibold leading-relaxed">Too many people think they failed because they weren’t tough enough. Usually, they were trying to carry the whole thing alone—with a generic plan that never accounted for real life.</p><p className="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/65">KO Fitness exists to close that gap: specific direction, real feedback, and someone who stays in the fight with you. The goal is not a temporary burst. It’s becoming the person who follows through.</p></div><div className="border-l-4 border-signal bg-ink p-7 text-bone"><p className="display text-3xl">Train with purpose. Driven by discipline.</p><p className="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone/65">Kyle has raced from 10Ks to ultra marathons and triathlons through the Half Ironman distance. In the past year, he earned age-group podiums across road, trail, and triathlon events—including first-place finishes in a trail half marathon and sprint triathlon, a 5:27 IRONMAN 70.3 Santa Cruz, and second place in his first 50K ultra.</p><p className="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone/65">Military and first responder discounts are available on request.</p></div></div></div></section>
</>; }
