/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/release/index.html:16:<section class="journey wrap" id="foundation" aria-labelledby="journey-title"><header class="journey-head"><p class="chapter">01 · From the court to the table</p><h2 id="journey-title">A career in having motion.<br><em>A platform taking shape.</em></h2><p>The game made Festus visible. Broadcasting gave him a new voice. Food opened the door to the people and businesses shaping the Bay.</p></header><ol class="route-timeline" aria-label="Festus Ezeli’s journey"><li><b>Vanderbilt</b><span>Economics, basketball and discovering a new path.</span></li><li><b>The NBA</b><span>First-round draft pick and 2015 NBA Champion.</span></li><li><b>Media</b><span>Warriors analysis, hosting and storytelling.</span></li><li class="active"><b>Festus Feasts</b><span>Food as an entry point into culture and local business.</span></li><li><b>Founder</b><span>Building partnerships that put value back into communities.</span></li><li><b>Next</b><span>Media, entrepreneurship and basketball’s future in Africa.</span></li></ol><div class="journey-proof"><figure><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="assets/champions-480.d38d34aff00e.webp 480w, assets/champions-800.8828905d676e.webp 800w, assets/champions-1200.ce99f380b04e.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) calc(100vw - 40px), 720px"><img src="assets/warriors-champions-2015.b87f4f666a41.jpg" width="4353" height="2902" alt="Festus Ezeli with the 2015 Golden State Warriors during a team visit to the Pentagon" loading="lazy"  decoding="async"></picture><figcaption>The 2015 Warriors; Festus stands in the back row. U.S. Department of Defense / public domain.</figcaption></figure><div><p class="pull">Athlete → Broadcaster → Storyteller → Founder</p><p>Today, Festus brings a player’s perspective to NBC Sports Bay Area and a founder’s responsibility to Festus Feasts.</p><figure class="history-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="assets/history-480.e826a8157856.webp 480w, assets/history-800.09f63350d99b.webp 800w, assets/history-1200.3723750ee4ff.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) calc(100vw - 40px), 480px"><img src="assets/warriors-2013.7b5878c66b3d.jpg" width="3529" height="2334" alt="Festus Ezeli, left, and Andris Biedrins during a Warriors game in 2013" loading="lazy"  decoding="async"></picture><figcaption>Festus Ezeli with Andris Biedrins, 2013. Matthew Addie / CC BY 2.0.</figcaption></figure><details><summary>The basketball record</summary><table class="honors" data-reveal><thead><tr><th>Milestone</th><th>Record</th><th>Context</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>NBA Draft</td><td>2012</td><td><a href="https://www.nba.com/stats/player/203105/career">Round 1 · Pick 30 ↗</a></td></tr><tr><td>NBA Champion</td><td>2015</td><td><a href="https://vucommodores.com/news/2015/06/17/ezeli-helps-lift-warriors-to-nba-championship">Golden State Warriors ↗</a></td></tr><tr><td>Regular-season career</td><td>170 / 61</td><td><a href="https://www.nba.com/blazers/trail-blazers-sign-festus-ezeli">Games / starts · 3 seasons played ↗</a></td></tr><tr><td>Finals clincher</td><td>10 / 4 / 1</td><td><a href="https://vucommodores.com/news/2015/06/17/ezeli-helps-lift-warriors-to-nba-championship">Points / rebounds / block · Game 6, 2015 ↗</a></td></tr></tbody></table></details></div></div></section>
