/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/release/index.html:18:<section class="portrait-voice" aria-label="Festus Ezeli on building Festus Feasts"><figure><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="assets/seated-480.bd87caa6d1de.webp 480w, assets/seated-800.85b6e232c854.webp 800w, assets/seated-1200.8690e4bbd2f5.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) calc(100vw - 40px), 560px"><img src="assets/festus-seated-portrait.568c843151c2.jpg" width="3840" height="5759" alt="A close portrait of Festus Ezeli seated at 9JaGrills in Oakland" loading="lazy"  decoding="async"></picture></figure><blockquote><p>“Food was the entry point. But what we’re really doing is telling the stories of people, neighborhoods and cultures.”</p><cite>Festus Ezeli · Founder’s note, 2026</cite></blockquote></section>
