/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/release/index.html:22:<section class="rebuild" id="listen" aria-labelledby="listen-title"><img class="rebuild-brand-mural" src="assets/rebuilding-beast-mark.7afa6f6f84f9.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true"><div class="wrap rebuild-grid"><div><p class="chapter">03 · Reinvention</p><h2 id="listen-title">When one route ends,<br><em>build another.</em></h2><blockquote>“I had to start my whole career over again.”</blockquote></div><div class="podcast-player"><p>An injury changed Festus’s basketball career. The questions that followed became <strong>Rebuilding the Beast</strong>: conversations about resilience, identity and finding a way forward.</p><div class="embed-slot" id="spotify-player"><button class="spotify-button js-only" data-spotify type="button"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12"/><path d="M5 9c4.8-1.4 9.5-.9 14 1.3M6 13c4-1.1 8-.7 11.8 1M7 16.5c3.2-.8 6.5-.5 9.5.8"/></svg><span>Listen on Spotify</span></button><p class="media-note">Loading the player connects to Spotify. Audio starts only when you choose play.</p></div><nav class="provider-links" aria-label="Podcast platforms"><a class="spotify-link" href="https://open.spotify.com/show/4BTDXnxSijylXEOIkPBSKm">Spotify ↗</a><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/rebuilding-the-beast/id1555868957">Apple Podcasts ↗</a></nav><p class="media-note" id="spotify-fallback">Listen directly if the player is unavailable.</p></div></div></section>
