/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/site/index.html:36:<section class="book" id="book" aria-labelledby="book-title"><div class="wrap booking-grid"><div><p class="chapter">10 · Prepare the introduction</p><h2 id="book-title">Make the first<br>message useful.</h2><p>This is a mockup site. If you like it, we can connect the finished site to your domain and email. For now, this brief is created locally; nothing entered here is submitted or stored.</p><a class="text-link" href="{{dest:contact}}">Skip to the official contact page ↗</a></div><form id="inquiry-form" class="js-only" novalidate><label for="category">What brings you here?</label><select id="category" name="category" required><option value="">Choose a category</option><option>Media appearance</option><option>Brand partnership</option><option>Restaurant feature</option><option>Speaking engagement</option><option>Private experience</option><option>General inquiry</option></select><p class="field-context" id="category-context">Choose what brings you to the table.</p><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required><label for="message">What should Festus’s team know?</label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" maxlength="3000" required></textarea><p id="form-error" class="form-error" role="alert"></p><button class="button primary" type="submit">Create my inquiry brief <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button><div id="brief-result" hidden><p role="status">Your brief is ready. It has not been sent or stored.</p><label for="brief">Copy this into your message</label><textarea id="brief" readonly rows="6"></textarea><button class="button" type="button" id="copy-brief">Copy inquiry brief</button><a href="{{dest:contact}}" class="text-link">Open official contact page ↗</a></div></form></div></section>
