/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-9-## Five competing directions
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-10-
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md:11:Scores below are design hypotheses, not user testing. Order: identity / originality / emotion / authenticity / commerce / photography / mobile / accessibility / maintenance / feasibility.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-12-
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-13-### 1. The Bay Area Field Guide
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-14-Thesis: Follow Festus through the Bay, one restaurant and one conversation at a time.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md:15:Architecture: places first; dinner, media and booking as supporting chapters. Hero: portrait beside a regional index. Narrative: map → people → dinner. Art: blue-slate cartography and orange route markers. Photography: owner-and-host pairs, food details. Type: a single humanist sans. Color: fog and orange. Interaction: geographic filters. Mobile: city-by-city itinerary. Conversion: watch a stop, visit a restaurant, book a meal. Weakness: reduces podcast and commercial work to an appendix.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-16-Scores: 9 / 9 / 8 / 9 / 8 / 9 / 9 / 9 / 9 / 9 = 88/100. Lost because the geography can overshadow the man.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-17-
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-18-### 2. The Documentary
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md:19:Thesis: A life rebuilt, told in three acts through portraiture, testimony and sound.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md:20:Architecture: chronological; actions at chapter exits. Hero: intimate full-screen portrait and a one-line premise. Narrative: Nigeria → championship → recovery → table. Art: cinematic crops, quiet captions. Photography: archival-to-contemporary progression. Type: serif display and neutral sans. Color: black, bone, restrained green. Interaction: one honors reveal. Mobile: short narrative spreads. Conversion: context first, actions later. Weakness: too much required reading before dinner or merch.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-21-Scores: 9 / 9 / 10 / 9 / 7 / 10 / 8 / 9 / 9 / 8 = 88/100. Lost because narrative would tax a visitor's immediate intent.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-22-
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-23-### 3. The Modern Supper Club
--
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-27-
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-28-### 4. The Cultural Publication
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-29-Thesis: A publication about the people who feed the Bay, edited through Festus's curiosity.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md:30:Architecture: stories, audio and film with a prominent commercial index. Hero: photographic cover with issue-like editorial hierarchy. Narrative: current features → origin note → deeper listening → actions. Art: asymmetrical spreads, no uniform cards. Photography: honest portraits and food, labeled video posters. Type: Georgia for authored headlines; system sans for controls. Color: fog, bone, slate, orange. Interaction: a personal reading/watch list. Mobile: compact publication index. Conversion: all four actions visible early. Weakness: could imply a newsroom or publishing cadence that does not exist.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-31-Scores: 9 / 9 / 9 / 9 / 9 / 10 / 9 / 9 / 9 / 9 = 91/100. Runner-up; rejected the invented issue/cadence framing.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-32-
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-33-### 5. The Open Table — selected living headquarters
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-34-Thesis: One host, many ways in: the Bay's tables, his conversations, and the work that connects them.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md:35:Architecture: four immediate actions; three short-to-expansive acts; six persistent lanes. Hero: intimate half-width portrait opposite a precise headline and four-action index. Narrative: present identity → compact foundation → intimate rebuild/audio → expansive current work. Art: editorial spreads with orange as a directional signal, no posterized likeness. Photography: realistic, portrait-led, licensed original photographs only at release. Type: Georgia for human editorial voice; system sans for utilities, a justified two-role pairing with no font downloads. Color: bone/fog/slate/orange, gold only in honors, green only in rebuild. Signature: The Table Plan, a session-only shortlist connecting restaurants and their stories, copied with source links. Mobile: the same content order with a 6-item safe-area dock. Conversion: dinner/shop/watch/work immediately and at close. Weakness: depends on approved contemporary photography and a real contact system.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-36-Scores: 9.5 / 9 / 9 / 9.5 / 9.5 / 9.5 / 9.5 / 9.5 / 9 / 9 = 93/100. Wins because present-day business stays legible without erasing the story. These are concept scores, not release scores.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-37-
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-38-## Signature mechanics
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-39-
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-40-- **Home Ground:** city filters with a schematic Bay illustration, not claimed precise navigation. Semantic restaurant list remains primary. Touch: 48px buttons; no JS: full list. Cost: inline SVG and a small filter handler.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-41-- **The Assist:** restaurant details disclose “Tell them Festus sent you.” This is a support invitation, not a partnership badge, discount or benefit. Native details works without JS; no animation required.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md:42:- **The Table Plan:** add verified stops, then copy a plain-text list with source links. Gives a fan a portable trail through Festus's discoveries. Touch/keyboard toggle buttons; live status; no persisted identity or location. Without JS, stop links and Assist remain usable. Cost: a few hundred lines of shared application code, zero libraries.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-43-- **The Honors Reveal:** one restrained entrance of the historical record; reduced motion renders immediately. No repeat count-up, no game UI.
/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md-44-
