/Users/zacfaber/festus-feasts-definitive/docs/CREATIVE.md:58:Existing editorial photographs have no recorded commercial permission. Local review may show clearly identified candidate assets, but the release validator must fail until permissions and the 8–12-image requirement are satisfied. No new photo licenses, emails, or infrastructure purchases are authorized. No production replacement is allowed while binary gates fail.
