/Users/zacfaber/kofitness-rebuild/KYLE-ASK.md-6-To finish it, I need six things from you:
--
/Users/zacfaber/kofitness-rebuild/KYLE-ASK.md-8-1. **Testimonials (2–3).** First name plus one specific result per client (e.g. "Maria: first half marathon, 2:04"), and their OK to post it.
/Users/zacfaber/kofitness-rebuild/KYLE-ASK.md-9-2. **Training photos you're cleared to use.** Especially the January 2025 starting point and USAT Nationals. Anything shot by a race photographer needs the purchased/licensed copy.
/Users/zacfaber/kofitness-rebuild/KYLE-ASK.md:10:3. **The $500/mo coaching details.** What's included (confirm the list on the site), how billing works, and your cancel and pause terms.
/Users/zacfaber/kofitness-rebuild/KYLE-ASK.md-11-4. **What "Apply for Coaching" should do.** Right now it opens the AI intake chat, and applications go to your email. Should it also book a call (Calendly?), or go somewhere else?
/Users/zacfaber/kofitness-rebuild/KYLE-ASK.md-12-5. **Races.** Send the real schedule (date, course, registration link) or tell me to hide the Races section until it's ready.
/Users/zacfaber/kofitness-rebuild/KYLE-ASK.md:13:6. **The coaching page URL.** The coaching link on kofitness.net currently 404s. Which URL should coaching live at? (And which email should applications go to?)
/Users/zacfaber/kofitness-rebuild/KYLE-ASK.md-14-
/Users/zacfaber/kofitness-rebuild/KYLE-ASK.md-15-No rush on all of it at once. Send what you have and I'll drop it in.
