/Users/zacfaber/nikhil-gupta-mock/agency/BLUE-CHIP-STANDARD.md:1:# THE BLUE-CHIP STANDARD — for creator websites
/Users/zacfaber/nikhil-gupta-mock/agency/BLUE-CHIP-STANDARD.md:5:**Perfect use of AI = the AI disappears into the creator.** The machine's job is fidelity, not flavor: the site must read as the creator's own work at its highest level — never as a template, never as AI output.
/Users/zacfaber/nikhil-gupta-mock/agency/BLUE-CHIP-STANDARD.md:6:**And at the same time: cunning edge.** Fidelity governs *identity*; ambition governs *craft*. The site is the creator at their most ambitious — what they would build with an unlimited budget and a world-class studio — still recognizably theirs, but the version that makes other creators jealous.
/Users/zacfaber/nikhil-gupta-mock/agency/BLUE-CHIP-STANDARD.md:9:1. **Look** — the creator's visual identity, exact: palette from their real content, their grid logic, their motifs. If a regular follower couldn't tell it apart from the creator's own aesthetic, it passes.
/Users/zacfaber/nikhil-gupta-mock/agency/BLUE-CHIP-STANDARD.md:10:2. **Feel** — the site's motion, density, and energy match the creator's vibe (chaotic creators don't get minimalist sites; calm creators don't get hype pages).
/Users/zacfaber/nikhil-gupta-mock/agency/BLUE-CHIP-STANDARD.md:13:5. **Their story** — the site tells the creator's story: the arc, the credibility, how they got here — not just services and prices.
/Users/zacfaber/nikhil-gupta-mock/agency/BLUE-CHIP-STANDARD.md:14:6. **Education exemplified** — if the creator teaches anything (recipes, technique, credentials, process), the site surfaces it and honors it as a pillar, not a footnote.
/Users/zacfaber/nikhil-gupta-mock/agency/BLUE-CHIP-STANDARD.md:16:8. **Sellable** — the site is built to convert at the creator's level: inquiry path, media kit, proof — the business machinery dressed in their identity.
/Users/zacfaber/nikhil-gupta-mock/agency/BLUE-CHIP-STANDARD.md:17:9. **Edge** — cunning AI and creative design at the frontier: interactions, layouts, and details a template can't imitate; AI used cleverly (live elements, smart intake, personal touches) in ways the visitor *feels* without seeing the strings. The site should feel like it arrived from the future of the creator's niche — wearing the creator's face.
/Users/zacfaber/nikhil-gupta-mock/agency/BLUE-CHIP-STANDARD.md:20:- **Taste Card** — the creator's look/feel/vibe/voice, extracted from real content + verified stats, is the input contract.
/Users/zacfaber/nikhil-gupta-mock/agency/BLUE-CHIP-STANDARD.md:21:- **SAM** verifies presence: real photos in place, sections complete, nothing empty.
