/Users/zacfaber/nikhil-gupta-mock/qa/codex-pro-run.log:388:TASTE CARD (Skill 001 — Creator Site):
/Users/zacfaber/nikhil-gupta-mock/qa/codex-pro-run.log:389:1. HERO: the visual that most immediately communicates his identity = a sweeping cinematic drone/aerial frame (coastline, city, or resort from above). If it doesn't read "cinematic travel creator for brands" in one second, it's the wrong hero. Anti-rule: no generic stock travel photo, no smiling-headshot hero.
