/Users/zacfaber/nikhil-gupta-mock/qa/codex-pro-run.log:391:3. SECTIONS from his strongest content pillars: (a) Selected work / destinations — story-led features of his best shoots, like Festus's spots but places and brand shoots; (b) Aerial — drone work as its own showcase; (c) Brands — hotels/airlines/destinations he creates for (only what his public profile supports); (d) Media kit — follower count + services for brand buyers; (e) Inquiry — one clean contact path (email + form-style CTA) for brand work.
/Users/zacfaber/nikhil-gupta-mock/qa/codex-pro-run.log:392:4. VOICE: write as him — minimal, confident, lets the visuals talk. Short lines. Anti-rule: no agency-speak, no hype adjectives stacked, no "passionate storyteller" clichés.
