at label scale and at button scale (primary on dark); never as a wash.

## Type

- Display: Archivo 500–900. Brand wordmark 900, uppercase, −0.015em, lh 0.84.
  Headlines 700–800, −0.025em. Numerals 800.
- Body: Instrument Sans. Lead = clamp(1.25–1.625rem).
- Labels: IBM Plex Mono, lowercase, tabular numerals — the flight-recorder voice.

## Space & shape

- --margin clamp(1.25–4rem); content max 1312px; section rhythm --space-section.
- Radius: 4px media, 10–12px form surfaces, 999px buttons. No cards on marketing
  sections — hairlines and type do the grouping (brands list, packages table).

## Motion

- Lenis on desktop fine-pointer only; native on touch.
- Reveal vocabulary (components/home/Reveal.tsx): [data-rise] line rises,
  [data-enter] 24px set-ins, batch-staggered.
- Hero: 2.6s settle (scale 1.12→1) + scrub parallax; the Aerial section's loop
  is the only perpetual motion. Everything off under prefers-reduced-motion;
  content is fully rendered server-side before any JS runs.

## Photography

- Focal points per breakpoint in assets/slots.json; derivatives AVIF/WebP/JPEG
  at 480/768/1080/1440/native via scripts/images.mjs.
- Frames are vertical (2160×3840) — layouts crop with object-position focals,
  never letterbox, never upscale.
